            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Companion 0.1.124</h2><ul><li>Makes phone pairing lossless so API keys, OAuth credentials, tunnel URLs, bridge credentials, and future setup fields survive QR and setup-link sync.</li><li>Refreshes pairing data whenever Pair Phone opens and tries both public HTTPS and Tailscale setup endpoints.</li><li>Makes Voice Dependency installation observable and prevents duplicate full HF runtime installs when several requirements are missing.</li><li>Improves OpenClaw and Hermes recent-session discovery for the VoiceClaw session browser.</li></ul>
]]></description>
